      "value": "I can easily recreate this is issue by switching to another program and back to VRChat 20 times.\n\nEvery time VRChat is selected as the active application the performance gets slightly worse.\n\nI attached a video showing it.\n\nBut this issue does not happen on every PC.\n\nA friend has this issue too but only on his main PC. His other PCs are not affected by this issue.\n\nWe couldn't narrow down to what hardware or even software in combination with VRChat is causing this.\n\nHere are my PCs specs:\n\nWin 11 Version 24H2\n\nRyzen 9800X3D\n\nNvidia 5090 with driver version 581.57\n\n1440p 120Hz Monitor\n\nHere is also the log file from the session from the video.",
