      "value": "It seems to me that when I move the mouse while holding down any button (left, right, or middle), the frame loss issue gets better. My pc is R5-4600H, 32GB RAM, and GTX 1650 (game ready driver 576.88). Whether using the integrated graphics or the dedicated GPU, moving the mouse causes frame drops (from 60 to below 10), but when I hold down a mouse button while moving, it only drops to 30.",
