      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am also having this issue. I have a Radeon RX 9070 with 16GB VRAM, and the lag happens even when I'm the only person in the world, so I don't think it's VRAM-related.\n\nMouse is a Logitech G502 X Lightspeed. Polling rate is set to 250hz, which isn't especially high. Framerate starts out fine, but after tabbing out and back in a few times, I notice that the framerate drops to around 50 FPS when I move my mouse. Later it gets so bad that it drops to single digits.\n\nThe view doesn't need to move to cause the lag. It happens when moving the mouse with the menu open too. It seems less severe when holding the middle mouse button, but is still noticeable.",
