      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having the same issue, WIndows 10, reproducible on Windows 11 as well. Running the game for hours in desktop mode and alt-tabbing makes the game stutter down to 0 FPS with mouse movement. Joystick camera movement does not affect FPS at all (Using DS4 controller). Bringing up in-game cam and moving it does not affect FPS, but moving the cursor while the camera GUI is up does. Grabbing any object and moving camera also does not affect FPS.\n\nWhile frames start dropping the total GPU usage drops to 4% from 22% for quest optimized world on 5070 ti.",
