      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The issue doesn't seem to appear after the interface update in open beta. What would usually take just half an hour switching back and forth, and framedrops would be abysmal - now I'm sitting at 440 minutes, only single hitch while opening the menu is happening. Moving mouse would not bring it to 1fps minimum.",
